{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Let\u2019s Paint Toast</i></strong> is a fast-paced, color-based puzzle game where precision and quick thinking are the keys to mastering chaos.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791080/extras/in_article.png?t=1749781662\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Paint</strong> slices of <strong>toast</strong> using <strong>red</strong>, <strong>yellow</strong>, and <strong>blue</strong>\u2014then <strong>deliver</strong> them to the <strong>matching colored blocks</strong>. <strong>Mix colors</strong> to create <strong>green</strong>, <strong>purple</strong>, and <strong>orange toast</strong>\u00a0as the difficulty ramps, demanding sharp hand-eye coordination and strategic decision-making as you aim for the <strong>leaderboard</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791080/extras/exp_sml.gif?t=1749781662\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play solo</strong> to test your reflexes, or team up with a friend in <strong>couch co-op</strong> or via <strong>Remote Play Together</strong> and climb the <strong>co-op leaderboard</strong>. Looking for competition? Challenge your friend head-to-head in the <strong>Versus</strong> mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced puzzle gameplay with a <strong>color-matching</strong> and mixing twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solo</strong> and <strong>local co-op</strong> play (Remote Play Together supported)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1v1 Versus</strong> mode for competitive fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global <strong>leaderboards</strong> for solo and co-op scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple to learn, hard to master</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3791080?t=1749781662","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3791080?t=1749781662","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791080/b3969171d8a12f0fdf745bf072573e2b85d3f50e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749781662","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791080/b3969171d8a12f0fdf745bf072573e2b85d3f50e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749781662","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Let\u2019s Paint Toast</i></strong> is a fast-paced, color-based puzzle game where precision and quick thinking are the keys to mastering chaos.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791080/extras/in_article.png?t=1749781662\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Paint</strong> slices of <strong>toast</strong> using <strong>red</strong>, <strong>yellow</strong>, and <strong>blue</strong>\u2014then <strong>deliver</strong> them to the <strong>matching colored blocks</strong>. <strong>Mix colors</strong> to create <strong>green</strong>, <strong>purple</strong>, and <strong>orange toast</strong>\u00a0as the difficulty ramps, demanding sharp hand-eye coordination and strategic decision-making as you aim for the <strong>leaderboard</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791080/extras/exp_sml.gif?t=1749781662\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play solo</strong> to test your reflexes, or team up with a friend in <strong>couch co-op</strong> or via <strong>Remote Play Together</strong> and climb the <strong>co-op leaderboard</strong>. Looking for competition? Challenge your friend head-to-head in the <strong>Versus</strong> mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced puzzle gameplay with a <strong>color-matching</strong> and mixing twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solo</strong> and <strong>local co-op</strong> play (Remote Play Together supported)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1v1 Versus</strong> mode for competitive fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global <strong>leaderboards</strong> for solo and co-op scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple to learn, hard to master</p></li></ul>","developers":["Ayrton Alexis"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791080/16d547df1c12d11e5fdac0e57d7f3ee00885f305/header.jpg?t=1749781662","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recom